      "duration_seconds": 23.61,
      "repeat_index": null,
      "warmup": true,
      "response": {
        "response_text": "Ko te kaitiakitanga te tiaki me te whakamarumaru. He huarahi hei whakahaere i te taiao e takea ana i te tirohanga Māori ki te ao [[1]](cite://1/1). He kaitiaki te tangata, te rōpū rānei e mōhiotia ana hei kaitiaki e te tangata whenua. Hei tauira, ka whakahaerehia pea tētahi roto, ngahere rānei e tētahi hapū [[2]](cite://2/1). Ka tipu mai te kaitiakitanga i te hononga hohonu o te tangata ki te whenua me te ao tūroa [[3]](cite://3/1). He whakamārama whānui noa tēnei, ehara i te kōrero mō tētahi iwi motuhake.\n\n## Sources\n\n[1] [Kaitiakitanga: Māori Guardianship, Environmental Stewardship, and Traditional Conservation Practices](https://teara.govt.nz/en/kaitiakitanga-guardianship-and-conservation)\n[2] [Kaitiakitanga: Māori Guardianship, Environmental Stewardship, and Traditional Conservation Practices](https://teara.govt.nz/en/kaitiakitanga-guardianship-and-conservation)\n[3] [Kaitiakitanga: Māori Guardianship, Environmental Stewardship, and Traditional Conservation Practices](https://teara.govt.nz/en/kaitiakitanga-guardianship-and-conservation)",
