      "duration_seconds": 21.18,
      "repeat_index": 1,
      "warmup": false,
      "response": {
        "response_text": "Ko te kaitiakitanga te tiaki, te pupuri me te whakamarumaru i te taiao, ā, i ahu mai i te tirohanga Māori ki te ao [[1]](cite://1/1). Ko te kaitiaki he tangata, he rōpū rānei e mōhiotia ana hei kaitiaki e te tangata whenua. Hei tauira, ka noho pea tētahi hapū hei kaitiaki mō tētahi roto, ngahere rānei [[2]](cite://2/1). Ka tipu mai te kaitiakitanga i te hononga hōhonu o te tangata ki te whenua me te ao tūroa [[3]](cite://3/1). E ai ki te Resource Management Act 1991, ko te kaitiakitanga te whakahaere i te kaitiakitanga e te tangata whenua o tētahi rohe, i runga i ngā tikanga Māori, tae atu ki te matatika o te manaaki taiao [[4]](cite://4/1). He mōhiohio whānui tēnei, ehara i te reo o tētahi iwi motuhake.\n\n## Sources\n\n[1] [Kaitiakitanga: Māori Guardianship, Environmental Stewardship, and Traditional Conservation Practices](https://teara.govt.nz/en/kaitiakitanga-guardianship-and-conservation)\n[2] [Kaitiakitanga: Māori Guardianship, Environmental Stewardship, and Traditional Conservation Practices](https://teara.govt.nz/en/kaitiakitanga-guardianship-and-conservation)\n[3] [Kaitiakitanga: Māori Guardianship, Environmental Stewardship, and Traditional Conservation Practices](https://teara.govt.nz/en/kaitiakitanga-guardianship-and-conservation)\n[4] [Kaitiakitanga: Māori Guardianship, Environmental Stewardship, and Traditional Conservation Practices](https://teara.govt.nz/en/kaitiakitanga-guardianship-and-conservation)",
